      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1269",
      "html": "<p>South America: Atlantic coast of southeastern Brazil, in rivers of Espírito Santo State. Type locality: Barra Sêca River at Linhares to São Mateus road, Espírito Santo State, Brazil. IUCN Red List category: Least Concern (last assessed 2018).</p>"
